| Alloy 330 | Ni 35, Cr 19, Fe bal, Si 1.1 | Heat treat fixtures | Yard tooling, not worn |
| N-155 / Multimet | Fe–Ni–Co–Cr–Mo–W | Old Fe-base superalloy | Historical |
| 16-25-6 | Fe–Ni 25, Cr 16, Mo 6 | Forgings | — |
| Invar 36 | Fe 64, Ni 36 | Not a superalloy; CTE≈0 | Dimensional jigs |
| Kovar | Fe–Ni–Co | Glass/ceramic seals | Sensor headers |
| Maraging 250 / 300 / 350 | Fe–Ni 18, Co 8–12, Mo 3–5, Ti | Ultra-high strength, not hot | Exo nodes if you have Co+Mo+Ti |
