## 7. Map onto EcoSuit-AS grades

| Grade | Allowed names on the drawing | Not allowed |
|---|---|---|
| A — meteoritic plate | “Fe–7Ni slagged, heat XXX” | Any Inconel / Haynes / CMSX name |
| B — belt stainless / Fe–Ni | A-286, Incoloy 800, 21-6-9-class, custom Fe–18Cr–8Ni | 718, SX, Re-bearing |
| C — Ni-base face | 600, 625, 617, 718, Haynes 230/282, Nimonic 263 | CMSX-4 on a pauldron |
| Cup / hatch / nozzles | 718, 625, Haynes 282, MP35N fasteners | Grade A only |
| Exo spider | Ti-6Al-4V (Earth) or maraging / A-286 if belt | Ceramic |
| Hardface | Stellite overlay on Grade A | Stellite as the whole scale |

